<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cesp 9-mo loss higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cesp 9-mo loss higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil state controlled power utility Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo (Cesp) issued the following statement on its 1996 nine-month results.</p>
<p>			    9-mo 96	  9-mo 95</p>
<p>    Loss		  397 million   Loss 132 million</p>
<p>    Net oper revs     1.7 bln	  1.3 bln</p>
<p>    Net worth	   12.6 bln	 12.5 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All data above in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415</p>
